# Historical Clothing: only the sources that are written by hand go in the repository.
# Generated or heavy files stay on disk only (they are rebuilt by the scripts in source/scripts):
release/
work/
docs/reports/img/
*.pbo
*.paa
*.p3d
*.blend
*.blend1
*.png
*.jpg
*.tga
*.bisign
*.bikey
*.biprivatekey
*.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# exception: small reference images that the docs need can be added with git add -f
# Since 2026-10-13 the project's own assets in source/ (blend, textures, P3D, PAA) and the renders in docs/renders are versioned too.
# work/ (NTW extracts, Arma 3 game files, builds), release/ (PBOs) and docs/references stay out: third-party or over the 100 MB GitHub limit.
!source/**/*.blend
!source/**/*.p3d
!source/**/*.paa
!source/**/*.png
!source/**/*.jpg
!source/**/*.tga
!docs/renders/**/*.png
!docs/renders/**/*.jpg
# obsolete/exploratory shako v1-v2: crops of the NTW atlas without authorization (docs/asset_inventory.md)
source/**/_obsoleto/
source/**/_exploratorio/
